<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan flour group to tender for 66,000T wheat.</title>
<headline>Taiwan flour group to tender for 66,000T wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Mills Association will tender on Friday for two 33,000-tonne shipments of U.S. wheat, association officials said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The first shipment is scheduled for July 15 to July 30 delivery from the Pacific Northwest, the second shipment is planned for August 5 to August 20 from the Pacific Northwest, an official said.</p>
<p>Details for the shipments are as follows:</p>
<p>  Type				Tonnes</p>
<p>Shipment One</p>
<p> Dark Northern Spring	   21,900</p>
<p> Hard Red Winter		   9,100</p>
<p> White Wheat			 2,000</p>
<p>Shipment Two</p>
<p> Dark Northern Spring	   19,800</p>
<p> Hard Red Winter		   9,000</p>
<p> White Wheat			 4,200</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-777-6958)</p>
